# Build context for infra/docker/web.Dockerfile only (repo root). apps/api
# is a separate npm project (own package.json/lockfile, not an npm
# workspace member of the root) and irrelevant to the web build -- excluding
# it here also keeps apps/api/.env (real local secrets) out of this context
# entirely, on top of apps/api/.dockerignore doing the same for its own
# build.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage
.angular
**/.angular
.git
apps/api
apps/mobile
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.log
.agents
docs
infra/compose
